  "reduction_policy": [
    "Lines are kept in their recorded order; a log line is kept when it holds an api_request or subagent_completed record of a chosen session, and a metric line when it holds a claude_code.cost.usage data point of one.",
    "Within a kept line only the records of chosen sessions stay, and each log record keeps only: event.name, session.id, workflow.run_id, query_source, agent.name, model, input_tokens, output_tokens, cache_read_tokens, cache_creation_tokens, cost_usd, duration_ms, agent_type, total_tool_uses and every kensai.* attribute, each with its recorded value object.",
    "A resource keeps only its kensai.* attributes. A metric keeps its name and, per data point, asDouble or asInt and its session.id attribute. Each line keeps its signal, received_at and body envelope.",
    "The one unreadable line is kept whole: it is the receiver's record of an empty export and carries no address."
